---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer>
  <div class="footer-blob" id="footerBlob"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h3>¿Nos vemos <span>en la carretera</span>?</h3>
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-col">
        <div class="footer-badge">LARA<br>MESANZA</div>
        <p>Camperización, viajes low-cost y cada producto que uso de verdad. Vivir bueno, bonito y barato, esté donde esté.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <span class="label">Explora</span>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/tienda">Tienda</a></li>
          <li><a href="/descuentos">Descuentos</a></li>
          <li><a href="/asesoramiento">Asesoramiento</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#videos-section">Vídeos</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contacto">Contacto</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <span class="label">Sígueme</span>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="#"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M22 12c0-1.5-.15-2.6-.5-3.5a3 3 0 00-2.1-2.1C18 6 12 6 12 6s-6 0-7.4.4A3 3 0 002.5 8.5C2.15 9.4 2 10.5 2 12s.15 2.6.5 3.5a3 3 0 002.1 2.1C6 18 12 18 12 18s6 0 7.4-.4a3 3 0 002.1-2.1c.35-.9.5-2 .5-3.5z"/><path d="M10 9.5l5 2.5-5 2.5v-5z" fill="var(--pine)"/></svg>YouTube</a>
          <a href="#"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1"/></svg>Instagram</a>
          <a href="#"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M16 3c.3 2 1.7 3.4 4 3.6v3c-1.5 0-2.8-.4-4-1.2v6.4a5.8 5.8 0 11-5-5.7v3.1a2.7 2.7 0 102.2 2.6V3h2.8z"/></svg>TikTok</a>
          <a href="mailto:lara.mesanza@gmail.com"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2.5"/><path d="M3.5 6l8.5 7 8.5-7"/></svg>Escríbeme</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">© {year} Lara Mesanza · laramesanza.com</div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer { background: var(--pine); color: var(--mist); padding: 100px 0 40px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .footer-blob {
    position: absolute; top: -20%; right: -10%; width: 500px; height: 500px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(193,96,47,0.1), transparent 70%); z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
  }
  footer .wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  footer h3 {
    font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em;
    font-size: clamp(2rem,5vw,3.4rem); color: var(--cream); max-width: 600px; line-height: 1.08;
  }
  footer h3 span { color: var(--pop); }
  .footer-grid { margin-top: 56px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; } }
  .footer-col span.label {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em;
    color: var(--sage); display: block; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .footer-col p { font-size: .88rem; opacity: .75; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 280px; }
  .footer-col ul { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .footer-col ul a { font-family: var(--display); font-size: .92rem; opacity: .85; transition: opacity .2s; }
  .footer-col ul a:hover { opacity: 1; color: var(--pop); }
  .footer-badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(243,239,228,0.25); font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 9px;
    text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .footer-links { margin-top: 44px; display: flex; gap: 30px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .footer-links a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 13px; opacity: .8; }
  .footer-links a svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
  .footer-bottom { margin-top: 70px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(243,239,228,.1); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .72rem; opacity: .45; }
</style>

<script>
  const footerBlob = document.getElementById('footerBlob');
  if (footerBlob) {
    const footerEl = document.querySelector('footer');
    const onScroll = () => {
      const fr = footerEl.getBoundingClientRect();
      footerBlob.style.transform = `translateY(${fr.top * -0.08}px)`;
    };
    const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    if (!prefersReduced) {
      window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });
      onScroll();
    }
  }
</script>
